/*!
\page page_stbtofpidtraits StBTofPidTraits

\brief Barrel TOF (BTOF) particle identification traits for a matched track.

\section stbtofpidtraits_overview Overview

\ref StBTofPidTraits stores PID information for a track geometrically matched to a hit
in the STAR Barrel Time-of-Flight detector (|η| < 0.9, ~100 ps resolution).  It provides
the measured TOF, path length, velocity β, and per-species nσ and probability values for
the four principal charged-particle hypotheses (e, π, K, p).

The associated \ref StBTofHit is linked via a smart \c StLink pointer.

\section stbtofpidtraits_hierarchy Class Hierarchy

\code{.txt}
StObject
  └── StTrackPidTraits
           └── StBTofPidTraits
\endcode

\section stbtofpidtraits_members Key Data Members

| Member | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| \c mMatchFlag | \c UChar_t | Track-to-hit matching quality (0 = unmatched). |
| \c mYLocal / \c mZLocal | \c Float_t | Local track coordinates at the matched cell (cm). |
| \c mThetaLocal | \c Float_t | Local incident angle (rad). |
| \c mPosition | \c StThreeVectorF | Global extrapolated position at the hit (cm). |
| \c mTimeOfFlight | \c Float_t | Measured TOF (ns); −999 if unset. |
| \c mPathLength | \c Float_t | Path length from vertex (cm); −999 if unset. |
| \c mBeta | \c Float_t | β = v/c; −999 if unset. |
| \c mSigma{Electron,Pion,Kaon,Proton} | \c Float_t | nσ from each hypothesis; −999 if unset. |
| \c mProb{Electron,Pion,Kaon,Proton} | \c Float_t | Hypothesis probabilities (0–1). |

\section stbtofpidtraits_example Usage Example

\code{.cpp}
const StBTofPidTraits* btof = nullptr;
for (const StTrackPidTraits* p : track->pidTraits()) {
    btof = dynamic_cast<const StBTofPidTraits*>(p);
    if (btof) break;
}

if (btof && btof->matchFlag() > 0) {
    double tof  = btof->timeOfFlight();   // ns
    double beta = btof->beta();           // v/c
    double p    = track->geometry()->momentum().mag();
    double m2   = p*p*(1./(beta*beta) - 1.);   // (GeV/c²)²

    if (std::abs(btof->sigmaKaon()) < 2.0) { /* kaon */ }
}
\endcode

\see StTrackPidTraits
\see StBTofCollection
\see StTrack
*/
